---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ProductSubNav from '../../components/ProductSubNav.astro';

const SUBNAV = [
  { label: 'All Eligible Products', href: '/preorder' },
  { label: 'Founder Benefits', href: '/preorder/founder-benefits' },
  { label: 'Preorder Terms', href: '/preorder/terms' },
  { label: 'Order Status', href: '/preorder/status' },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Order Status | Preorder | ByteLite LLC"
  description="How to check the status of a ByteLite LLC founder reservation."
  keywords="ByteLite LLC preorder status"
  noindex={true}
>
  <Header slot="header" />
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Preorder', href: '/preorder' }, { label: 'Order Status' }]} /></div></section>
  <ProductSubNav items={SUBNAV} />

  <section class="os-hero">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Order Status</p>
      <h1>No dedicated lookup system yet — here's what's true today.</h1>
      <p class="os-p">
        Founder reservations currently go through the <a href="/contact" style="color:#818cf8;">contact page</a>
        rather than a self-serve status portal. There is no per-order secure token or account
        system live for reservations yet, so this page does not claim one exists.
      </p>
      <div class="os-box">
        <h3><span class="os-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M8 2v4M16 2v4"/></svg></span>What's planned</h3>
        <p>Once a real paid preorder or reservation flow exists for a specific product, this page
        will support a secure, server-generated lookup — either bound to an authenticated account
        (if one exists by then) or a unique lookup token emailed at reservation time. It will never
        expose another person's order through a predictable identifier.</p>
        <div class="os-steps">
          <div class="os-step os-step-done"><span class="os-step-dot"></span>Contact-based reservation (live today)</div>
          <div class="os-step"><span class="os-step-dot"></span>Server-generated lookup token</div>
          <div class="os-step"><span class="os-step-dot"></span>Self-serve status portal</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="os-p" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        For the restaurant partner program specifically, sign-up status is visible directly on the
        <a href="/products/heartstrings-connect/date-planning/restaurants/partner-program" style="color:#818cf8;">signup page</a> after logging in — that system is separate and already live.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
.os-hero { padding: 4.5rem 0 4rem; }
.os-p { font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #a0a8c0; }
.os-box { margin-top: 1.75rem; background: #0d1120; border: 1px solid #1a2235; border-radius: .75rem; padding: 1.75rem; }
.os-box h3 { color: #e4e7f2; margin-bottom: .75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .625rem; }
.os-icon { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 2rem; height: 2rem; border-radius: .5rem; background: rgba(129,140,248,.12); color: #818cf8; flex-shrink: 0; }
.os-box p { font-size: .9375rem; color: #7b829e; line-height: 1.7; }
.os-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .625rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #1a2235; }
.os-step { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .625rem; font-size: .875rem; color: #555e7a; }
.os-step-done { color: #34d399; }
.os-step-dot { width: .5rem; height: .5rem; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; flex-shrink: 0; }
</style>
